- attach_task_profile: deletes route_task_profile_available ?route_task_profile.
- attach_service_window: deletes service_window_available ?service_window.
- confirm_equipment_assignment: (no deletes? Actually effect includes candidate_staged_for_loading and equipment_confirmed; no deletes.)
- verify_loading_profile_*: no deletes.
- establish_clearance_*: no deletes (just adds).
- finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation: adds candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready; no deletes.
- verify_compliance_certificate: adds compliance_validation_complete; no deletes.
- confirm_operator_alignment: adds operator_alignment_confirmed; no deletes.
- apply_operational_constraint: adds constraint_applied; deletes operational_constraint_available.
- validate_route_sequence: adds route_sequence_validated; no deletes.
- finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation: adds candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready; no deletes.
- finalize_candidate_direct: adds candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready; no deletes.
- mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready: adds dispatch_ready; no deletes.
- mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready: adds dispatch_ready; no deletes.
- execute_origin_dispatch: adds dispatched ?origin_availability, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot; deletes dispatched? Actually effect includes dispatched ?origin_availability (adds), vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit (adds), dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot (adds). No deletes.
- execute_destination_dispatch: similar.
- execute_schedule_dispatch: similar.
- allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate: adds dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot; deletes dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot.
- lock_origin_availability: adds origin_availability_locked and origin_availability_confirmed; no deletes.
- lock_destination_availability: similar.
- activate_origin_node: adds origin_node_ready; no deletes.
- activate_destination_node: adds destination_node_ready; no deletes.
- load_origin_payload: adds origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, origin_payload_linked; deletes cargo_available ?payload_unit.
- unload_origin_payload: adds origin_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, cargo_available ?payload_unit; deletes origin_payload_linked ?origin_availability ?payload_unit.
- load_destination_payload: adds destination_node_occupied, destination_availability_locked, destination_payload_linked; deletes cargo_available ?payload_unit.
- unload_destination_payload: adds destination_node_ready, destination_availability_confirmed, cargo_available ?payload_unit; deletes destination_payload_linked.
- assemble_transport_leg: adds transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked; deletes transport_leg_available ?transport_leg.
- assemble_origin_loaded_leg: adds transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, origin_leg_loaded; deletes transport_leg_available.
- assemble_destination_loaded_leg: adds transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, destination_leg_loaded; deletes transport_leg_available.
- assemble_fully_loaded_leg: adds transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, origin_leg_loaded, destination_leg_loaded; deletes transport_leg_available.
- authorize_transport_leg_loading: adds transport_leg_loading_authorized; no deletes.
- stage_schedule_candidate: adds candidate_staged_for_loading; no deletes.
- reserve_equipment_resource: adds equipment_reserved, candidate_equipment_linked; deletes equipment_available.
- confirm_equipment_assignment: adds candidate_staged_for_loading, equipment_confirmed; no deletes.

